    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "College Manor is located off Hoey`s Lane, so it enjoys a location that is convenient to town and several schools, as well as nearby supermarket and retail park. \n\nThe house overlooks a large green area and additionally has a good sized enclosed back garden. \n\nThe house comes to market in excellent condition, meaning its next owner or occupant will have zero work to do. Highlights include:\n•Large living room with gas fire and b ay window \n•Large kitchen-diner with breakfast bar \n•Low maintenance enclosed back garden \n•Guest wc \n•3 double bedrooms principle ensuite \n•4th single bedroom \n•Upgraded main bathroom \n \nThe house is also located beside the future Dundalk University (currently Institute of Technology) and is very convenient to town and the M1. \n"
      },
      {
